Version: {{VERSION}}
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6, libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1
Maintainer: BetterLC contributors <me@ehko.dev>
Homepage: https://github.com/ehkogh/BetterLC
Description: Privacy-focused launcher for Lunar Client
 Starts Lunar Client without Lunar's own launcher and cuts off the
 data Lunar collects about you and your computer.
